OL,3,ATourism tax needs to be more flexible
OL,4,Ain Wales, warns expert
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said the
OL,7,Flegislation allowed for decisions to be
OL,8,Ftaken at a local level, with councils
OL,9,Fable to introduce the levy "to support
OL,10,Finvestment in tourism services and
OL,11,Ffacilities".
